{"id":"dc1823720b241378","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-betweenness.md","title":"Betweenness","display":"df-betweenness — Betweenness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-betweenness","aliases":["58-df-betweenness","Betweenness"],"display":"df-betweenness — Betweenness","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-betweenness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-betweenness</span><span>Betweenness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-betweenness — Betweenness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"58-df-metric-space\">58-df-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x, y, z \\in M\">\\(x, y, z \\in M\\)</span> (points)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Between}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Between}_S\\)</span> (metric-betweenness predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_S\">\\(B_S\\)</span> (metric-segment set defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness} \\vdash \\operatorname{Between}_S(x,z,y;M,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)\\land x,y,z\\in M\\land d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness} \\vdash \\operatorname{Between}_S(x,z,y;M,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)\\land x,y,z\\in M\\land d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness\\text{-}segment} \\vdash B_S(x,y;M,d)\\coloneqq \\{z\\in M:d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness\\text{-}segment} \\vdash B_S(x,y;M,d)\\coloneqq \\{z\\in M:d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Metric betweenness records equality in the triangle inequality. It does not imply uniqueness of geodesics in an arbitrary metric space.</li>\n<li>Ordered geometry (Hilbert): axioms for &quot;betweenness&quot; as primitive relation</li>\n<li>Busemann: spaces where betweenness determines convexity; behave like <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Helly: intersection of convex sets property via betweenness hyperplane separation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Blumenthal, Distance Geometry</li>\n<li>Busemann, The Geometry of Geodesics</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)$ (metric-space predicate, see [[58-df-metric-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x, y, z \\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Between}_S","display":false},{"tex":"B_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness} \\vdash \\operatorname{Between}_S(x,z,y;M,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(M,d)\\land x,y,z\\in M\\land d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}betweenness\\text{-}segment} \\vdash B_S(x,y;M,d)\\coloneqq \\{z\\in M:d(x,y)=d(x,z)+d(z,y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-betweenness.md|58-df-betweenness]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97"]}